# Normalize line endings: everything text is committed and checked out as LF,
# on every platform. This keeps the compile-time embedded assets
# (include_str! of assets/*.js / *.css) byte-identical across OSes — CRLF
# checkouts on Windows would otherwise change the served page (and break
# tests that parse it).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.icns binary
